// (task-postwork DESIGN §2). OPTIONAL, and declaring it moves the find /
// create-if-absent / read out of the agentic phase: the dispatch resolves the
// title to a number and hands the agent that number as binding scope. The title
// is declared rather than derived because these trackers already exist across
// the fleet under titles a scheme would not reproduce, and renaming one orphans
// every run logged to it.
