1	// The executor loop end to end against a fake GitHub — pick, claim, evaluate,
2	// prework, hand off, converge. The pure rules are tested beside this; what this
3	// pins is that the SHELL actually drives them to a terminal state, which is the
4	// thing a fixture over the rules alone can never say.
5	
